      "id": "msg_0274_00119",
      "en_US": [
        "A wonderfully refreshing field\n",
        "for a Stroll. You can meet many\n",
        "kinds of Pokémon here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00120",
      "en_US": [
        "A large natural forest that has\n",
        "been allowed to grow. Many\n",
        "Pokémon live deep in the forest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00121",
      "en_US": [
        "A hilly, rugged mountain road.\n",
        "The view from atop the mountain\n",
        "is very beautiful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00122",
      "en_US": [
        "This beautiful sea is a popular\n",
        "place for a Stroll. You can meet\n",
        "many Water-type Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00123",
      "en_US": [
        "A residential area somewhere.\n",
        "Even when you take a Stroll\n",
        "here, you can meet Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00124",
      "en_US": [
        "A dark cave sometimes used as a\n",
        "test of courage. Look closely,\n",
        "and you’ll find many Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00125",
      "en_US": [
        "A deep, blue lake. It’s said that\n",
        "some rare Pokémon live at the\n",
        "bottom of this lake."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00126",
      "en_US": [
        "The outskirts of a town. Where\n",
        "people have moved away,\n",
        "Pokémon have moved in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00127",
      "en_US": [
        "A Route that goes deep into the\n",
        "Hoenn region. You can meet many\n",
        "Pokémon not in Johto or Kanto."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00128",
      "en_US": [
        "A very warm beach in the Hoenn\n",
        "region. You can meet many\n",
        "Pokémon not in Johto or Kanto."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00129",
      "en_US": [
        "A path through a currently\n",
        "active volcano. Very fiery and\n",
        "rare Pokémon live here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00130",
      "en_US": [
        "A path that works with the\n",
        "trees of the forest. Pokémon\n",
        "here are always changing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00131",
      "en_US": [
        "A pitch-black cave that seems\n",
        "haunted. It’s said that many\n",
        "Pokémon live deep inside."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00132",
      "en_US": [
        "A Route through the Sinnoh\n",
        "region, far from Johto and\n",
        "Kanto. Rare Pokémon live here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00133",
      "en_US": [
        "A snow-covered road where a\n",
        "misstep could result in a fall--\n",
        "it tests your trust in Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00134",
      "en_US": [
        "A forest surrounded by many old\n",
        "trees since the olden days.\n",
        "Many Pokémon live here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00135",
      "en_US": [
        "A lake concealed in white mist.\n",
        "It lends a very mysterious feel\n",
        "to the area."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00136",
      "en_US": [
        "Strong waves wash onto this\n",
        "beach. Because people don’t\n",
        "visit, rare Pokémon live here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00137",
      "en_US": [
        "A high-class resort everyone\n",
        "wants to visit, famous for the\n",
        "cute Pokémon living here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00138",
      "en_US": [
        "A quiet, deep, and empty cave.\n",
        "If you look carefully, you’ll find\n",
        "some rare Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00139",
      "en_US": [
        "A small island far away on the\n",
        "horizon. If you look to the sea,\n",
        "you can see Pokémon swimming."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00140",
      "en_US": [
        "A dark mountain path that gives\n",
        "you the feeling you’ve traveled\n",
        "through time back to the past."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00141",
      "en_US": [
        "Many PIKACHU live in harmony in\n",
        "this forest. Walk through here\n",
        "frequently, and try to find one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00142",
      "en_US": [
        "A fun Route to play with your\n",
        "Pokéwalker. Take a Stroll and\n",
        "visit the many places!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00143",
      "en_US": [
        "You can find many Pokémon on\n",
        "this Route. Take a long walk and\n",
        "see if you can find them all!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0274_00144",
      "en_US": [
        "If you’re aiming to be Champion,\n",
